{
  "id": 8834164129991,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Below Hoop Comforter with Name and Number Design 1",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-below-hoop-comforter-name-number-e8b829a176-e8b829a176",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring the excitement of the court straight to your bedroom with the custom Sports Comforter from Jeminise. This personalized bedding set features a vibrant basketball design, making it the perfect custom gift for sports enthusiasts, players, and kids. Fully customizable with a name and number, it adds a unique, personal touch to any sports-themed bedroom decor.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own Name and Number for a truly unique and personal sports bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric that is soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Construction:</strong> Features a whole-piece microfiber filling with tight, smooth, and compact stitching along the edges to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Comfort:</strong> Lightweight yet cozy design provides comfortable warmth suitable for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low or air-dry setting to restore its fluffiness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Basketball D01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Vintage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
